    "notes": "The announcement of a Gospel read from the first words of its book. INÍTIUM is the nominative of a heading, with no verb expressed or understood; SANCTI agrees with EVANGÉLII; SECÚNDUM with the accusative names the evangelist. The same frame as the announcement of the Last Gospel.",
